  "titleEn": "Plans and the Future",
  "grammarTip": "Namjeravati and planirati (+ infinitive) express intentions and plans: 'Namjeravam upisati fakultet' (I intend to enroll in college). After temporal conjunctions like kad/čim (when/as soon as) that point to a future event, Bosnian keeps the subordinate verb in the present tense rather than the future: 'Kad završim školu, naći ću posao' (When I finish school, I'll find a job) — never 'kad ću završiti'.",
